  "releaseNotes": "Use expressions to obtain generic MethodInfo:\n      - Replace reflective MethodInfo searches with direct delegate/expression-based lookups.\n      - LuciferModel now uses delegate Method.Properties to get generic method definitions for GetModelI/SetModelI/GetModelT/SetModelT.\n      - SimulationManager adds System.Linq.Expressions and a SimulationDummyEvent type, and computes s_createEventGeneric via an expression-based MethodCall to obtain CreateEvent<T>'s generic MethodInfo.\n      - This simplifies and speeds up generic MethodInfo resolution and avoids scanning all methods via reflection.",
